---
import Sparkles from "lucide-astro/Sparkles";
import LayoutGrid from "lucide-astro/LayoutGrid";
import MousePointerClick from "lucide-astro/MousePointerClick";
import Shield from "lucide-astro/Shield";
import GitFork from "lucide-astro/GitFork";
import ChevronDown from "lucide-astro/ChevronDown";
import ExternalLink from "lucide-astro/ExternalLink";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import PageHeader from "../components/layout/PageHeader.astro";
---

<Layout title="About">
  <PageHeader
    title="About"
    subtitle="Why this dashboard exists, what it does, and where the data comes from."
  />

  <section class="space-y-8">
    <!-- Overview (matches Hiring Tips section title + cards) -->
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-6">Overview</h2>
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <article
          class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border border-border-light dark:border-border-dark bg-surface-light dark:bg-surface-dark p-6"
        >
          <header class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <Sparkles
              class="h-10 w-10 text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400 shrink-0"
              aria-hidden="true"
            />
            <h3
              class="text-base font-semibold leading-tight text-text-light dark:text-text-dark"
            >
              Why I built it
            </h3>
          </header>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-mutedLight dark:text-text-mutedDark">
            The original project is an amazing resource, but browsing a huge
            list in markdown can be slow and frustrating. This dashboard is
            focused on clarity, scanning, and quick navigation.
          </p>
          <ul
            class="mt-1 list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-text-mutedLight dark:text-text-mutedDark marker:text-accent"
          >
            <li>Consistent layout and typography</li>
            <li>Fast visual scanning (remote/hybrid/in-office, locations)</li>
            <li>One click to careers pages</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article
          class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border border-border-light dark:border-border-dark bg-surface-light dark:bg-surface-dark p-6"
        >
          <header class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <MousePointerClick
              class="h-10 w-10 text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 shrink-0"
              aria-hidden="true"
            />
            <h3
              class="text-base font-semibold leading-tight text-text-light dark:text-text-dark"
            >
              What you can do here
            </h3>
          </header>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-mutedLight dark:text-text-mutedDark">
            Use this UI for discovery, not as a promise. Treat it as a starting
            point for your own validation.
          </p>
          <ul
            class="mt-1 list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-text-mutedLight dark:text-text-mutedDark marker:text-accent"
          >
            <li>
              Browse companies in a styled grid or list instead of a README
            </li>
            <li>Read interview-process notes at a glance (when provided)</li>
            <li>Open careers pages quickly to verify what’s current</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Details (progressive disclosure) -->
    <article
      class="rounded-xl border border-border-light dark:border-border-dark bg-surface-light dark:bg-surface-dark overflow-hidden"
    >
      <div class="px-6 py-5">
        <h3
          class="text-base font-semibold leading-tight text-text-light dark:text-text-dark"
        >
          Details
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-text-mutedLight dark:text-text-mutedDark">
          Expand for notes on scope, design, and corrections.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-t border-border-light dark:border-border-dark">
        <details class="group">
          <summary
            class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-6 py-4 list-none
                     hover:bg-bg-light dark:hover:bg-bg-dark
                     group-open:bg-bg-light dark:group-open:bg-bg-dark
                     focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent
                     transition-colors duration-200 ease-in-out motion-reduce:transition-none"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <Shield
                class="h-8 w-8 text-accent/80 group-open:text-accent shrink-0"
                aria-hidden="true"
              />
              <span class="font-semibold text-sm">What this isn’t</span>
            </div>
            <ChevronDown
              class="h-5 w-5 text-accent/80 group-open:text-accent transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"
              aria-hidden="true"
            />
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pt-2 pb-6">
            <p class="text-sm text-text-mutedLight dark:text-text-mutedDark">
              This site doesn’t “certify” companies. Interview processes can
              change.
            </p>
            <ul
              class="mt-3 list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-text-mutedLight dark:text-text-mutedDark marker:text-accent"
            >
              <li>Not a hiring platform or recruiter tool</li>
              <li>Not an endorsement of any company</li>
              <li>Not a guarantee an interview process stays the same</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>

      <div class="border-t border-border-light dark:border-border-dark">
        <details class="group">
          <summary
            class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-6 py-4 list-none
                     hover:bg-bg-light dark:hover:bg-bg-dark
                     group-open:bg-bg-light dark:group-open:bg-bg-dark
                     focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent
                     transition-colors duration-200 ease-in-out motion-reduce:transition-none"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <LayoutGrid
                class="h-8 w-8 text-accent/80 group-open:text-accent shrink-0"
                aria-hidden="true"
              />
              <span class="font-semibold text-sm">Design goals</span>
            </div>
            <ChevronDown
              class="h-5 w-5 text-accent/80 group-open:text-accent transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"
              aria-hidden="true"
            />
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pt-2 pb-6">
            <p class="text-sm text-text-mutedLight dark:text-text-mutedDark">
              I’m optimizing for a calm, readable experience that works well in
              both light and dark mode.
            </p>
            <ul
              class="mt-3 list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-text-mutedLight dark:text-text-mutedDark marker:text-accent"
            >
              <li>Accessible contrast and focus styles</li>
              <li>Consistent components across pages</li>
              <li>Minimal friction between discovery and applying</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>

      <div class="border-t border-border-light dark:border-border-dark">
        <details class="group">
          <summary
            class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-6 py-4 list-none
                     hover:bg-bg-light dark:hover:bg-bg-dark
                     group-open:bg-bg-light dark:group-open:bg-bg-dark
                     focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent
                     transition-colors duration-200 ease-in-out motion-reduce:transition-none"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <GitFork
                class="h-8 w-8 text-accent/80 group-open:text-accent shrink-0"
                aria-hidden="true"
              />
              <span class="font-semibold text-sm"
                >Contributing & corrections</span
              >
            </div>
            <ChevronDown
              class="h-5 w-5 text-accent/80 group-open:text-accent transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"
              aria-hidden="true"
            />
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pt-2 pb-6">
            <p class="text-sm text-text-mutedLight dark:text-text-mutedDark">
              If something looks wrong or outdated, the best place to fix it is
              the original dataset. That way the entire community benefits.
            </p>
            <ul
              class="mt-3 list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-text-mutedLight dark:text-text-mutedDark marker:text-accent"
            >
              <li>Submit corrections in the upstream repo</li>
              <li>Verify details on the company careers page</li>
              <li>Assume processes change over time</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>

      <div class="border-t border-border-light dark:border-border-dark">
        <details class="group">
          <summary
            class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer px-6 py-4 list-none
                     hover:bg-bg-light dark:hover:bg-bg-dark
                     group-open:bg-bg-light dark:group-open:bg-bg-dark
                     focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent
                     transition-colors duration-200 ease-in-out motion-reduce:transition-none"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <ExternalLink
                class="h-8 w-8 text-accent/80 group-open:text-accent shrink-0"
                aria-hidden="true"
              />
              <span class="font-semibold text-sm">Data source</span>
            </div>
            <ChevronDown
              class="h-5 w-5 text-accent/80 group-open:text-accent transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"
              aria-hidden="true"
            />
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pt-2 pb-6">
            <p class="text-sm text-text-mutedLight dark:text-text-mutedDark">
              Company data originates and is manually synced from the upstream
              community repository when updates are published.
            </p>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/poteto/hiring-without-whiteboards"
              target="_blank"
              class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-accent hover:underline focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent rounded-sm"
            >
              hiring-without-whiteboards
              <ExternalLink class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true" />
            </a>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>
</Layout>
